feat 1.0

# ADR-0034: with an observes line, a capture reference inside a list item naming a configured service the spec does not observe is UNOBSERVED_SERVICE (parsed with fixtures/parse-observes.config.json).

spec SPEC-BAD-134 "Capture reference inside a list naming an unobserved service"
context Bad
aggregate Thing
type command
status draft
observes eventStore

construct:
  handler at src/do-thing.ts
  touches src/**

enforce:
  do the thing

contract:
  input ThingInput
  response ThingResult
  record ThingRow

scenario "does the thing":
  when: DoThing { value: 1 }
  predict success:
    response OK ThingResult
    eventStore has [ Wrote with ThingRow { members: [ { id: @cache[0].id } ] } ]
